  "description": "”The bike became not only a workhorse but also, it was a joy to ride. With its faster-than-average speeds and snappy handling it quickly became my do-it-all bike.” Read the full review here.\nWho said a fat bike can't be as fun to ride as a mountain bike? The Chic-Chocs 3 is part of our new generation of fat bikes, offering an exceptional trail experience. Agile and responsive on the climb, stable and fast on the descent, it's designed to eat up the miles on your favorite singletrack or explore new areas on an overnight stay in a refuge.\nIts modern geometry, corrected for the addition of suspension, offers even more confidence on the trails. Combining a narrow crankset axle and lightweight carbon-reinforced construction, the Chic-Chocs pedals efficiently in a variety of contexts.\nWant to go further than usual? Storage space in the downtube and 18 mounting points offer multiple options for adding equipment to your bike.\n* The frameset comes with wheel axles, headset, seatpost collar, frame protectors and UDH hanger.",
